  "description": "OEDRO step bars feature a unique drop-down design, perfectly tailored for the 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL & Wrangler Unlimited 4-Door. With a 3.5-inch drop, they provide easier access—ideal for vehicles with lift kits and oversized tires. Designed for both style and functionality, these step bars enhance convenience while maintaining a rugged, off-road-ready look.\nFeatures\nRust-Resistant & Easy to Clean: Crafted from rust-resistant carbon steel and finished with a durable powder coating, these step bars ensure long-lasting protection. The geometric plate panel minimizes mud splashes and allows for effortless cleaning.\nQuick & Easy Installation: Pre-welded brackets simplify the setup with minimal parts—no cutting or drilling required. Designed for a hassle-free, time-saving installation.\nErgonomic Drop Step Design: Featuring a sleek black and silver finish with a 3.5-inch drop, these running boards provide easy access, especially for children and the elderly. The step plates are paintable for a personalized touch.\nStrong & Durable: Built to withstand tough conditions, the premium powder coating resists rust and corrosion. A precision laser-cut step plate offers a non-slip surface and reinforced grip. Supports up to 450 lbs for reliable performance.\n1-year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door",
